# Tuned-PX4 baseline v2: v1 (px4_tuned_v1.params, frozen, kept for the results flown on it)
# with one change, barometer height: EKF2_HGT_REF 0 instead of 3 (vision). Zain's call on
# 2026-11-01 (docs/decisions.md): with vision as the height reference EKF2's height freezes
# when the VIO goes quiet and the vehicle can sink unseen (docs/field-faults.md), and the
# partner pack tells partners not to fly it, so the benchmark no longer measures that set-up.
# Every result from 2026-11-01 on is compared against this file. Until 2026-11-02 the line read
# EKF2_HGT_REF 1, which PX4 v1.17 numbers GPS height, not barometer; with GPS off EKF2 falls
# back to the barometer, so every flight on this file flew on barometer height either way, and
# 0 says so directly (docs/decisions.md, 2026-11-02; docs/log-health.md). Nothing else differs from v1;
# its notes on each value apply:
#
# 1. EKF2 on vision for xy and velocity, barometer height, GPS off: as
#    sim2real/estimate_bridge/ekf2_ev.params (the estimate path is part of the benchmark).
# 2. Attitude and rate loops: PX4's autotune result for the gz_x500 (v1, docs/baseline.md).
# 3. Horizontal position and velocity loops: hand-tuned for wind (v1, docs/baseline.md).
# QGroundControl plain-text format (vehicle_id, component_id, name, value, type 6 int / 9 float),
# applied at boot as PX4_PARAM_* by sim2real/estimate_bridge/run_estimate.py --params.
1	1	EKF2_EV_CTRL	7	6
1	1	EKF2_HGT_REF	0	6
1	1	EKF2_GPS_CTRL	0	6
1	1	SYS_HAS_GPS	0	6
1	1	EKF2_EV_DELAY	100.0	9
1	1	EKF2_EV_NOISE_MD	1	6
1	1	EKF2_EVP_NOISE	0.1	9
1	1	EKF2_EVV_NOISE	0.1	9
1	1	MC_ROLLRATE_P	0.1466	9
1	1	MC_ROLLRATE_I	0.1958	9
1	1	MC_ROLLRATE_D	0.0029	9
1	1	MC_ROLL_P	6.5	9
1	1	MC_PITCHRATE_P	0.1102	9
1	1	MC_PITCHRATE_I	0.1466	9
1	1	MC_PITCHRATE_D	0.00212	9
1	1	MC_PITCH_P	6.5	9
1	1	MPC_XY_P	1.5	9
1	1	MPC_XY_VEL_P_ACC	3.0	9
1	1	MPC_XY_VEL_I_ACC	2.0	9
1	1	MPC_XY_VEL_D_ACC	0.3	9
